    "detailed_description": "<h1>THANK YOU!!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/02c1f02d23fe33533278b4c25f72a76f.avif?t=1689761117\" /></span><br><br>Now that Alpha 2 test has concluded, we would like to extend our gratitude for all the support we've received in the past week. It really means a lot and help us do what we love to ensure you the best gaming experience through Farsiders. THANK YOU!<br><br><br>While we are working tirelessly to improve and polish Farsiders, here is a short &quot;gameplay preview&quot; footage from the recent Alpha test here. Check it out! (Click the banner to watch.)</p><br><h1>Join the squad!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>FARSIDERS is an action game inspired by classic legends. Embark on a journey between past and present in a world filled with technology and magic. Adventure through an intense storyline to meet legendary heroes, discover new spell cards, fight and performs various fancy fighting skills against historical villains, and save the world from this new imminent threat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/41464d4a360d16cc414b485376c432e9.avif?t=1689761117\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>Join Cassandra or Cassie, the Spectralon\u2019s youngest member who encountered the notorious terrorist called \u201cThe Soul Syndicate\u201d.<br><br><br>Things take turns when the leader of the Soul Syndicate uses the dark magical forces to open a mysterious portal that had led Cassie through time into the mythical realm and experience the ancient legend kingdom to stop Soul Syndicate\u2019s mission.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/1c6bb49f71e976fd6160e5c9c35cc1ff.poster.avif?t=1689761117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/1c6bb49f71e976fd6160e5c9c35cc1ff.webm?t=1689761117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/1c6bb49f71e976fd6160e5c9c35cc1ff.mp4?t=1689761117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2>The combat system in FARSIDERS is a real-time hack-and-slash. Unleash your skills and face over 30 different sorts of baddies, and make some actions against thrilling bosses in unforgettable fights throughout the game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/70b56ed62c9fce11a50e3a324de842f4.avif?t=1689761117\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Technology and Magic</h2>Being a Spectralon means you have a choice of weapons to choose from! Whether it\u2019s a sword, gun, or even magic. Collect as many spell cards as possible and combine them with your favourite Spectek weapons to fit your playstyle and defeat your enemy with a deadly blow.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/f1c23bf8cbd36088785072fb5ec8e2a4.poster.avif?t=1689761117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/f1c23bf8cbd36088785072fb5ec8e2a4.webm?t=1689761117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/f1c23bf8cbd36088785072fb5ec8e2a4.mp4?t=1689761117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Voyage</h2>As Cassie dives into another realm, people consider her a \u2018Farsider.\u2019 An adventure between \u201cOstahl\u201d the new world, and \u201cTellune\u201d the old world. Explore and lead Cassie through this mission to unravel the secrets of the magic realm and live to tell the tale!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/e93a603bde6b0218a4547fc7edbe629a.avif?t=1689761117\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the legends</h2>Welcome to Camelot! During the mission, you will meet a variety of new pals, even famous heroes like Lancelot and many more. Get to know their story and embrace new friendships, whether it\u2019s a friend or foe!",
    "about_the_game": "FARSIDERS is an action game inspired by classic legends. Embark on a journey between past and present in a world filled with technology and magic. Adventure through an intense storyline to meet legendary heroes, discover new spell cards, fight and performs various fancy fighting skills against historical villains, and save the world from this new imminent threat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/41464d4a360d16cc414b485376c432e9.avif?t=1689761117\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>Join Cassandra or Cassie, the Spectralon\u2019s youngest member who encountered the notorious terrorist called \u201cThe Soul Syndicate\u201d.<br><br><br>Things take turns when the leader of the Soul Syndicate uses the dark magical forces to open a mysterious portal that had led Cassie through time into the mythical realm and experience the ancient legend kingdom to stop Soul Syndicate\u2019s mission.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/1c6bb49f71e976fd6160e5c9c35cc1ff.poster.avif?t=1689761117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/1c6bb49f71e976fd6160e5c9c35cc1ff.webm?t=1689761117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/1c6bb49f71e976fd6160e5c9c35cc1ff.mp4?t=1689761117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2>The combat system in FARSIDERS is a real-time hack-and-slash. Unleash your skills and face over 30 different sorts of baddies, and make some actions against thrilling bosses in unforgettable fights throughout the game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/70b56ed62c9fce11a50e3a324de842f4.avif?t=1689761117\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Technology and Magic</h2>Being a Spectralon means you have a choice of weapons to choose from! Whether it\u2019s a sword, gun, or even magic. Collect as many spell cards as possible and combine them with your favourite Spectek weapons to fit your playstyle and defeat your enemy with a deadly blow.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/f1c23bf8cbd36088785072fb5ec8e2a4.poster.avif?t=1689761117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/f1c23bf8cbd36088785072fb5ec8e2a4.webm?t=1689761117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/f1c23bf8cbd36088785072fb5ec8e2a4.mp4?t=1689761117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Voyage</h2>As Cassie dives into another realm, people consider her a \u2018Farsider.\u2019 An adventure between \u201cOstahl\u201d the new world, and \u201cTellune\u201d the old world. Explore and lead Cassie through this mission to unravel the secrets of the magic realm and live to tell the tale!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2281310/extras/e93a603bde6b0218a4547fc7edbe629a.avif?t=1689761117\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the legends</h2>Welcome to Camelot! During the mission, you will meet a variety of new pals, even famous heroes like Lancelot and many more. Get to know their story and embrace new friendships, whether it\u2019s a friend or foe!",
    "short_description": "'Farsiders' is a top-down (isometric view) 3D action Hack-and-Slash RPG game set in a stylized futuristic cyberpunk world. Embark on a journey as 'Cassie' to the past with references to real world legends (Arthurian) where the worlds of sci-fi technology and medieval magic collide.",
